            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Erratum to: Can J Anesth/J Can Anesth DOI 10.1007/s12630-015-0428-6. In the published version, the first phrase of the introduction was incorrect and should read as follows: Since the inception of the postanesthesia care unit (PACU) in 1923, the question of when it is safe to discharge a patient has remained contentious. The publisher apologizes most sincerely for this typesetting error.</AbstractText>
